title: Role assignment at RUNNING (contract v3, 2026-10-01)

participants: Control, Bit, Agent, Device

note: request_start accepts: run() sets RUNNING (lobby down), then materialize
# Scored first, in validation order.
note: per validated dev: its reserved scored role
Control -> Bit: on_join(dev, scored role)
Control -> Agent: on_grant(dev, role blob)
Agent -> Device: /<dev>/role scored (TCP)
# Then every other pooled dev: not a fixture, not an admin id.
note: per other dev: first fitting unscored role, else solo:<instrument>
Control -> Bit: on_join(dev, jam role)
Control -> Agent: on_grant(dev, role blob)
Agent -> Device: /<dev>/role jam (TCP)
Control -> Bit: on_run_start()
note: RUNNING walk-up: a first hello gets the jam steps at once
